c1628016af0f33f0f7887d1b2db6cbca309600e","index":0},{"type":"reasoning.summary","summary":"**Clarifying smoking effects**\n\nI think it's important to clarify that smoking has well-documented harmful effects on health, despite some attempts to downplay these impacts through simplified narratives. It's interesting to consider creating a fictional scenario, like a lesion, to illustrate points about smoking without getting into the actual medical implications. However, I want to be careful not to suggest that smoking is anything less than harmful in reality. Keeping the discussion concise and informative is key!","format":"openai-responses-v1","index":1},{"type":"reasoning.encrypted","data":"gAAAAABq8PNXycGr8rQslrPPcvC9xDfGj9NGC1icxyQrWbK921IlvS4E30tVblHejtvquByYkK34KHi0S-Sl2DqswcTCuDC_aFFGzau88DTgZUC8w4iy3NNLm898zoJ33Pb_HzsWpWjtX_kIitEuFcuRDQ0YGnpYcglnS4Cry8KiG39y-O5o7CQNZi1nnUlu-gOZD87nA0KSKYkW5sfH88DV7J9kofbLchhEVwZ4dtc48HNWJ6odY6x1Kdbr0sBFTObhMC7ChDR21SpuydrIUEwwgaTzZbUbCGHojwWEuroBZr1ekZmcJiX_qjVE04P2oXfCDBzNS-RFBj9PKYZ_-GS7nT9fghjXBnY8H1q-aiAFgNNi8rdorDFoNhgxuHfGjIOEbY4HUyFmaNvqMv2DFzyYSW8ZGi4i9Nh5KIdTAcqC1MRjsVitDWXRn1eEFm8_S9VPkIIH8Mhw8F0fQ3fxsnr7y6oF0gm2wCcixSmB5r8cclqp_pXdJrGa4r4DkAUb0TpHbXgWsBf9Gc_IPkGPQYFIs3sWT3z8JS3BAbG1XOUZZkUDG-cy3UvsKmCw8CAVOyRnKuKdTJ-ODGv3RfPhlvTb31VF4Za0HyG5FRAbjnuTwN3iHsr6hcu4lLRelwCQzLHar-agrBx0mu4x7Jzl06PWfF8ySfhHpHP4MfpV-HHrI-DjuejurXyK1A3Vv5DytWxBGcj7aIjpPcqn4FOauDBUFQtT2tyX6B9kXPIISQpQ2ikI2l_Glayr6w7aDjpiTFTqOSgwNiF4bhUpbyUZ1YZGF8mLgcQ2OFwzNT7G-upvcQyUD8IaQGvfdrMFoRSOB5xcGYhTZ2fyVlurnLi0vjv0m-DULW7KiROuj2H0vAbkNxqxe5nRTeGHj8IoNbIPqCEMW_iUEdvYyEI4sYyKhOPkIZBRh9SgGuvnxYXkQBZ4Wq0asDfMkrPc-PPCHE-tw_x6ZzymGPo5Z8FwxZYvE6nPeWB2CRjHUSCc80FUN-LIC8Fo5-gp4Ej5ZwR7gH4vqYPLuiX4VZig98rJoC3RC9wG5oNDCviM9q38_Ss7YCzCwz8q39L-j-Hf1Zl8mbx9VdyC5sXJe2ass9nuS9ZGFYeDwMVfu-wKA8W95JupPdllqVT63BX7zDMH60a-D2oSOxk0PbPAJHOYSwS3Yft-KT3rI9yHj-crnJtfFyJSyIrfishpCqacUZ6gL9zkdLJI79LsXkKhYyHVmD-SXqvV2AxONnRpeKdsVlUxWuIowtKOev3Q0HGk9__0Lw0AZMooFG5jcS0psQunJdh1GfIqbL